    textSpeed: 0.022
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - 'Haha, <b><i>Senator Mahalia Lapuz</i></b> got into a real big controversy
      because she was cracking down on illegal gambling rings... '
