      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: The distrust in salakab in your time would make it difficult for it
        to be used morally and efficiently. It is not a good idea to surrender it
        to people threatened by it, so keep it on you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: <SFX_liezel_thinking>Indeed. You might have just found a fragment of
        <b>salakab</b>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
