    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: <i>(Oh, a chess board. Looks like the game got cut off before it could
        finish</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: <i>(Only the kings and pawn-... Is that real gold? Awfully wasteful
        to buy a golden chess piece.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: <i>(Whoever was playing this golden king will be cornered by pawns and
        the other king, if it keeps going left.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4746459191129394785, guid: e03ab5007ef7b460e9e1351d398246ac, type: 3}
